   "text": "MÁQUINAS DE ESTADO\n\nTRABAJO: QUEUED → ANALYZING → COMPLETED | FAILED | CANCELLED | EXPIRED (terminal no se\nreabre).\nCASO: PENDING → IN_REVIEW → VERIFIED | DISMISSED | ESCALATED (VERIFIED → ESCALATED\nexplícito).\nEXPORTACIÓN: PREPARING → VERIFYING → READY → DOWNLOADED (≠ recepción).\nLa UI traduce estados al español.",
   "originalText": "MÁQUINAS DE ESTADO\n\nTRABAJO: QUEUED → ANALYZING → COMPLETED | FAILED | CANCELLED | EXPIRED (terminal no se\nreabre).\nCASO: PENDING → IN_REVIEW → VERIFIED | DISMISSED | ESCALATED (VERIFIED → ESCALATED\nexplícito).\nEXPORTACIÓN: PREPARING → VERIFYING → READY → DOWNLOADED (≠ recepción).\nLa UI traduce estados al español.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "rectangle-1127",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
